# Per-worktree sweep scaffolding. These must be ignored in their symlink/file
# form too, not just as directories: a lane worktree links assets/ and venv/ to
# the trunk, and a directory-only pattern left the symlinks untracked-but-not-
# ignored, so an agent's `git add -A` committed them. Landing that on trunk
# replaced the real assets/ and venv/ with symlinks to themselves - every
# venv/bin/python3 then failed with ELOOP and the next landing could not take
# the merge lock.
/.split.log
/OVERLAY_BRIEF.md

# peassets ladder logs (regenerated each run)
tools/peassets/logs/

.bulk_m2c/
.promote-logs/


# Worktree setup log written by the demotion scripts.
.setup.log

build-port/

# Matching-toolchain binaries and Sony's Psy-Q objects stay out of this repository.
